---
// Plain typographic legal page (04-BUILD-SPEC.md build order, step 8).
// 03-CONTENT.md is explicit about this exact topic: "regulatory disclosure
// language should not be drafted by a developer, or by an AI." The age
// statement below is the one piece of wording the content doc actually
// supplies (verbatim, same as the footer) — everything else here is a
// placeholder pending the compliance officer, not invented copy.
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Responsible play — Magnus Ark" description="Responsible play information.">
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Responsible play</h1>

      <!-- Verbatim from 03-CONTENT.md §9 — do not edit without compliance sign-off. -->
      <p class="age-statement">
        The platforms we support are restricted to persons 21 years and
        older. Government employees, military personnel, and persons on the
        national exclusion list are prohibited from participating.
      </p>

      <p class="legal-pending">
        {"{{TBD: this page is pending review by the client's compliance officer. It should cover self-exclusion, spend and time controls, and where to get help — none of that is drafted here, per 03-CONTENT.md's own instruction that this wording should come from compliance, not a developer or an AI.}}"}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    background: var(--ark-paper, #f2f4f9);
    padding: 6em 0;
    min-height: 60vh;
  }

  .legal-page .container {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .age-statement {
    font-size: 1.1em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-pending {
    background: #fff;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--ark-brass, #c9a24a);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    font-size: 0.95em;
    color: #4b4b48;
  }
</style>
